		note="The player package, rendered from its own parts. Every specimen holds a store of its own, so the live bar at the foot of this page keeps the module singleton and nothing here hijacks it. No specimen reaches the network: the stream resolver answers from the payload it was handed, and each loaded state is set on the store directly, because building the audio graph needs a gesture."
